WEBVTT

01:29.370 --> 01:34.350
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.890 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 26]

01:41.350 --> 01:43.350
Then let me ask you something first.

01:50.710 --> 01:52.229
Are you doing this

01:52.229 --> 01:54.930
because Zhou Wan
got the short end of the stick

01:55.350 --> 01:57.750
or because you've genuinely thought about

01:57.789 --> 01:59.520
how this would benefit Lan Yue?

02:13.820 --> 02:15.680
I know what you're worried about.

02:16.110 --> 02:17.870
But setting all that aside,

02:19.120 --> 02:20.710
whoever I'm doing this for,

02:21.840 --> 02:22.990
the long-term value

02:23.010 --> 02:24.360
this proposal

02:24.360 --> 02:25.590
could bring to Lan Yue

02:25.750 --> 02:27.150
is undeniable.

02:29.370 --> 02:30.770
I've thought about this.

02:31.530 --> 02:32.420
I also know

02:32.730 --> 02:34.210
our team has never

02:34.520 --> 02:35.710
developed an original

02:35.710 --> 02:37.040
IP from scratch before.

02:37.150 --> 02:39.360
That's why I'm not planning
to do this alone.

02:39.360 --> 02:40.520
As long as you give me

02:40.800 --> 02:41.600
the go-ahead,

02:42.079 --> 02:43.890
I'll put the team together immediately

02:43.890 --> 02:46.620
and take charge of
making the whole thing happen.

02:47.079 --> 02:48.190
Alright. Go do it.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.280
Really?

02:53.190 --> 02:54.190
Whoever you think you are,

02:54.190 --> 02:55.470
get out of my aunt's body right now.

02:55.470 --> 02:56.280
Who else could I be?

02:56.280 --> 02:57.710
I'm your favorite aunt.

02:59.000 --> 02:59.590
To be honest,

02:59.590 --> 03:00.520
it's not like

03:00.540 --> 03:02.540
I've never considered this before.

03:02.760 --> 03:04.050
It's just that

03:04.630 --> 03:05.680
building our own IP system
from the ground up

03:05.680 --> 03:07.280
comes with enormous risks.

03:07.700 --> 03:08.860
Given my position,

03:08.880 --> 03:10.480
there's only so much I can do.

03:10.800 --> 03:12.110
But like you said,

03:12.910 --> 03:14.120
the value of developing our own IP

03:14.120 --> 03:15.800
goes far

03:15.800 --> 03:17.530
beyond the financial returns.

03:18.020 --> 03:20.020
I've always wanted to give it a shot.

03:20.120 --> 03:22.240
I just needed someone

03:22.240 --> 03:24.770
with the vision
and the guts to make it happen.

03:24.920 --> 03:25.630
And right now, you seem like

03:25.630 --> 03:27.090
exactly the right person.

03:27.410 --> 03:29.340
-You caught me.
-I caught you once.

03:29.380 --> 03:31.180
You're not a little kid anymore.

03:31.840 --> 03:34.000
Go for it.

03:34.450 --> 03:35.970
Get this moving as soon as possible.

03:35.970 --> 03:37.030
I'll handle the board

03:37.030 --> 03:38.090
and convince them.

03:38.100 --> 03:39.320
But I'm only giving you

03:39.320 --> 03:40.130
two weeks.

03:41.170 --> 03:42.430
I won't need two weeks.

03:42.540 --> 03:43.579
Ten days will do.

03:44.380 --> 03:45.579
That confident, huh?

03:46.750 --> 03:48.590
So is this really

03:48.800 --> 03:49.930
because of Zhou Wan?

03:54.980 --> 03:56.120
I knew it.

03:56.700 --> 03:57.720
You're so petty.

04:00.810 --> 04:02.970
[One day to Jiang Fan's birthday]

04:21.459 --> 04:23.990
This camera is a real classic.

04:24.020 --> 04:25.150
It's hard to buy now.

04:25.610 --> 04:26.570
Who is it for?

04:27.350 --> 04:28.720
My soon-to-be ex-husband.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.210
Let me see.

04:29.210 --> 04:31.180
Looks like you're not over him yet.

04:31.210 --> 04:32.470
I bought it a long time ago.

04:32.470 --> 04:33.430
I'd completely forgotten about it.

04:33.430 --> 04:34.230
Right.

04:34.250 --> 04:35.600
What are you talking about?

04:35.600 --> 04:37.120
-You look so happy.
-We talked about ex-brother-in-law.

04:37.120 --> 04:38.159
Here, Meng.

04:38.510 --> 04:39.270
What is this?

04:39.290 --> 04:40.670
-What is it?
-A birthday invitation.

04:40.670 --> 04:41.240
Give me one.

04:40.760 --> 04:42.050
[Looking forward to seeing you.
Let's raise a glass to 29]

04:41.260 --> 04:41.730
Here.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.170
and make more unforgettable
memories together.—Jiang Fan]

04:42.310 --> 04:42.940
An invitation?

04:42.940 --> 04:43.920
Isn't this the brother-in-law's

04:43.920 --> 04:44.920
birthday invitation?

04:44.920 --> 04:45.950
Ex.

04:45.970 --> 04:47.630
And there's one for each person.

04:47.630 --> 04:49.430
Everyone got one.

04:49.450 --> 04:50.159
Right?

04:52.690 --> 04:54.040
Is he out of his mind?

04:59.330 --> 05:00.390
So... are we going?

05:03.650 --> 05:04.700
Don't bother.

05:25.800 --> 05:26.390
Exactly.

05:35.130 --> 05:35.880
[Jiang Fan's birthday tomorrow.
Let's go together.]

05:35.900 --> 05:38.590
[No need to bring anything.]

05:38.710 --> 05:42.870
[See you in the basement garage.]

05:47.940 --> 05:49.600
Message from your boyfriend?

05:51.790 --> 05:52.580
No.

05:52.610 --> 05:54.630
Wan, with someone like you,

05:54.750 --> 05:55.870
if he's not your boyfriend,

05:55.870 --> 05:57.310
then he must be a suitor, right?

05:57.310 --> 05:58.510
Yeah.

05:58.610 --> 05:59.730
Yeah.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.190
No, really.

06:01.330 --> 06:02.330
It's okay.

06:02.350 --> 06:03.480
It's fine. Ms. Wan,

06:03.510 --> 06:04.820
if you have a date,

06:04.840 --> 06:05.650
just go.

06:05.680 --> 06:06.600
We've got everything covered here.

06:06.600 --> 06:07.950
We'll send you the list

06:07.980 --> 06:09.120
once it's organized.

06:09.120 --> 06:09.590
Sure.

06:09.770 --> 06:10.430
Sure.

06:10.430 --> 06:11.310
You should go.

06:11.310 --> 06:12.600
The more hands, the better.

06:12.600 --> 06:13.600
-I'm not leaving.
-Yes.

06:13.600 --> 06:15.530
Look, Director Lu hasn't left yet.

06:16.190 --> 06:17.310
He's not staying

06:17.310 --> 06:17.990
just because he feels bad

06:17.990 --> 06:19.140
about us working overtime, is he?

06:19.140 --> 06:19.950
Don't you have any shame?

06:19.950 --> 06:22.310
Look how shameless you are.

06:22.400 --> 06:24.060
Look at Director Lu staring at his phone.

06:24.060 --> 06:24.920
Maybe he has some

06:24.920 --> 06:26.510
important work or

06:26.800 --> 06:27.480
a date.

06:27.480 --> 06:29.770
Exactly.

06:29.890 --> 06:30.620
Very likely.

06:31.380 --> 06:32.460
Then who is it?

06:32.490 --> 06:33.750
Who are you messaging?

06:33.970 --> 06:34.980
Yeah.

06:35.290 --> 06:37.850
Ms. Wan, your phone is ringing again.

06:37.850 --> 06:41.170
-It's ringing again!
-Who is it?

06:42.650 --> 06:44.050
My family.

06:44.050 --> 06:46.010
Family, huh?

06:46.200 --> 06:47.490
That's right. Family.

06:47.490 --> 06:47.930
Really?

06:47.930 --> 06:48.680
I'll...

06:48.680 --> 06:49.730
I'll go handle it.

06:49.760 --> 06:50.290
Okay.

06:50.290 --> 06:51.360
We've got this covered.

06:51.360 --> 06:52.200
Okay.

06:52.200 --> 06:53.680
I'll come back to work.

06:53.680 --> 06:54.730
Okay.

06:54.730 --> 06:57.060
-We know. Nobody said you were.
-Go ahead.

06:57.240 --> 06:58.460
Director Jiang, you...

06:58.460 --> 06:59.240
Well, Director Jiang,

06:59.240 --> 07:01.000
if you've got a date too,
you can head out.

07:01.000 --> 07:01.800
We've got everything covered here.

07:01.800 --> 07:03.230
Don't you have a girlfriend?

07:03.230 --> 07:05.830
I... I don't have a girlfriend.

07:07.040 --> 07:08.890
-Nothing.
-No girlfriend.

07:09.050 --> 07:10.610
If you don't have a girlfriend,
Director Jiang,

07:10.610 --> 07:12.650
how about picking one

07:12.680 --> 07:14.140
from the bunch?

07:17.650 --> 07:18.610
Director Jiang...

07:18.610 --> 07:20.360
Are you chatting or

07:20.930 --> 07:21.850
working?

07:22.010 --> 07:22.720
Working.

07:25.090 --> 07:25.730
Got it.

07:30.660 --> 07:32.390
Li Xin, are you done with yours?

07:33.120 --> 07:34.000
I had her send it to me.

07:34.000 --> 07:34.850
I've got it.

07:35.960 --> 07:36.830
Okay.

07:50.170 --> 07:52.570
Why are you acting so secretive
over a text?

07:55.090 --> 07:57.240
I didn't want everyone
getting the wrong idea.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.100
The wrong idea?

07:58.680 --> 07:59.490
About what?

08:02.000 --> 08:03.520
About us.

08:04.610 --> 08:05.850
What exactly are we?

08:13.800 --> 08:14.650
What are we?

08:15.970 --> 08:17.290
You know what I mean.

08:21.090 --> 08:23.210
You're the one acting guilty.

08:26.290 --> 08:27.320
So what

08:27.320 --> 08:28.650
if they see me texting you?

08:28.650 --> 08:29.980
Don't we work together?

08:33.080 --> 08:34.370
So... are you coming or not?

08:34.370 --> 08:35.100
Where to?

08:35.960 --> 08:38.960
Jiang Fan's birthday party.
Don't tell me you forgot.

08:39.730 --> 08:40.929
Are you coming or not?

08:41.370 --> 08:42.960
Are you coming or not?

08:43.049 --> 08:44.530
Gu Meng might not even be going to

08:44.530 --> 08:45.800
Jiang Fan's birthday party.

08:45.800 --> 08:46.760
Why would I?

08:46.840 --> 08:48.470
Besides, there'll be so many people.
It'll be a whole scene.

08:48.470 --> 08:50.370
Whether Gu Meng goes is her business.

08:50.370 --> 08:51.700
Whether you go is yours.

08:51.890 --> 08:52.960
And knowing her,

08:52.960 --> 08:54.080
she'll definitely be there.

08:54.080 --> 08:54.880
Are you going?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.930
Mengmeng asked me out tomorrow.

08:58.930 --> 09:00.050
If she's going,

09:00.050 --> 09:00.650
I'll

09:01.560 --> 09:02.680
just go with her.

09:04.370 --> 09:06.030
What's she asking you out for?

09:06.960 --> 09:08.410
What's she asking you out for?

09:08.410 --> 09:09.870
We're going to see a movie.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.480
Since when do you get to police that?

09:31.290 --> 09:32.790
See how annoying he is?

09:32.930 --> 09:33.480
I got him

09:33.480 --> 09:34.370
such an important birthday present,

09:34.370 --> 09:35.800
and this is how he repays me.

09:35.800 --> 09:36.650
I'm not staying a second longer

09:36.650 --> 09:37.910
than I have to tonight.

09:41.300 --> 09:42.410
Alright.

09:42.410 --> 09:43.480
You already bought the gift.

09:43.480 --> 09:45.100
Don't waste your money.

09:46.440 --> 09:47.840
Let me touch up my makeup.

09:49.560 --> 09:51.440
t's just your soon-to-be
ex-husband's birthday.

09:51.440 --> 09:53.050
Why are you putting
so much effort into it?

09:53.050 --> 09:55.440
Exactly because

09:55.530 --> 09:57.290
it's my soon-to-be ex-husband's birthday.

09:57.290 --> 09:58.600
You're saying one thing
and feeling another.

09:58.600 --> 09:59.250
What?

09:59.440 --> 10:00.930
I'm dropping off the gift and leaving.

10:00.930 --> 10:02.590
You could've mailed it to him.

10:03.200 --> 10:04.410
Oh, you're doing this
on purpose, aren't you?

10:04.410 --> 10:05.440
Fine, let me ask you something.

10:05.440 --> 10:06.200
How's living

10:06.200 --> 10:07.440
with Lu Xixiao going?

10:07.440 --> 10:09.560
Who cooks? Who does the dishes?

10:09.560 --> 10:12.010
-Do you sleep in the same bed
or separately?
-Okay. I can't win an argument with you.

10:12.010 --> 10:13.660
You win. I was wrong.

10:16.010 --> 10:17.080
So annoying.

10:17.080 --> 10:18.170
The movie sucked,

10:18.170 --> 10:20.170
and now I have to go see my ex tonight.

10:21.680 --> 10:22.730
It was alright.

10:22.840 --> 10:24.700
Aren't all genre films like that?

10:25.650 --> 10:26.580
I'm telling you,

10:26.720 --> 10:28.370
that whole "taking the knife" scene

10:28.370 --> 10:30.030
was nothing but forced drama.

10:30.250 --> 10:31.480
No normal person would just stand there

10:31.480 --> 10:32.800
and take the stab.

10:32.960 --> 10:34.690
They'd shove her out of the way.

10:34.800 --> 10:36.050
And even if he did get stabbed,

10:36.050 --> 10:37.290
it'd be in the back,

10:37.290 --> 10:38.600
not the chest.

10:47.300 --> 10:48.720
He's a cop.

10:48.720 --> 10:49.440
Doesn't he know

10:49.440 --> 10:51.440
a chest wound is far more dangerous?

10:51.480 --> 10:53.410
I can't stand plot holes like that.

10:56.800 --> 10:58.250
Maybe it was just instinct.

10:58.250 --> 10:59.050
Impossible.

10:59.410 --> 11:01.010
We actually interviewed
experts about this.

11:01.010 --> 11:02.640
There was proper research.

11:03.320 --> 11:04.650
In the most realistic scenario,

11:04.650 --> 11:06.050
the guy would instinctively dive in

11:06.050 --> 11:07.580
and knock her out of the way.

11:07.600 --> 11:09.840
Besides, people act on instinct.

11:10.200 --> 11:11.440
Even if he valued his own life

11:11.440 --> 11:12.530
more than hers,

11:12.530 --> 11:15.130
he still wouldn't react
the way they showed it.

11:16.050 --> 11:16.650
Let's go.

11:18.410 --> 11:18.960
Let's go.

11:19.950 --> 11:27.960
[China Film Cinemas]

11:26.250 --> 11:27.050
Wait.

11:28.050 --> 11:29.600
I'm seriously going dressed like this?

11:29.600 --> 11:30.650
I'm going to steal the show

11:30.650 --> 11:31.840
tonight.

11:33.540 --> 11:34.620
Let's go buy a new outfit.

11:34.620 --> 11:36.850
[China Film Cinemas]

11:35.560 --> 11:36.090
Let's go.

11:36.970 --> 11:39.890
[Age doesn't matter—happiness forever.
Happy Birthday!]

11:38.480 --> 11:39.960
Everyone, eat up and enjoy yourselves!

11:39.960 --> 11:40.890
Jiang Fan!

11:40.960 --> 11:42.150
Time to cut the cake!

11:42.250 --> 11:43.600
Cut the cake!

11:43.770 --> 11:45.080
Cut the cake!

11:45.080 --> 11:45.970
Thank you.

11:46.370 --> 11:47.130
A few people still haven't arrived yet.

11:47.130 --> 11:48.290
Can we wait a few more minutes?

11:48.290 --> 11:49.130
Okay.

11:49.160 --> 11:49.840
We'll wait.

11:49.840 --> 11:50.440
Go on in and have fun first.

11:50.440 --> 11:51.080
Just wait a few minutes.

11:51.080 --> 11:51.890
Okay.

11:55.800 --> 11:56.290
I'm telling you,

11:56.290 --> 11:57.680
Jiang Fan can't stand people being late.

11:57.680 --> 11:58.930
And I already threw away
the gift wrapping.

11:58.930 --> 11:59.990
Let's piss him off.

12:09.600 --> 12:10.320
What is it?

12:11.260 --> 12:12.550
A "bomb".

12:13.890 --> 12:14.480
What?

12:14.800 --> 12:15.370
Are you trying to turn my birthday

12:15.370 --> 12:16.900
into my death anniversary?

12:17.320 --> 12:18.200
I wish.

12:18.650 --> 12:20.050
What kind of bomb is this?

12:23.290 --> 12:24.690
Where did you even buy it?

12:25.370 --> 12:27.230
You really went all out on me, huh.

12:27.680 --> 12:28.690
Thanks, honey.

12:28.770 --> 12:31.170
Since when am I your wife?
Watch your mouth.

12:35.650 --> 12:36.740
Zhou Wan!

12:36.890 --> 12:38.440
-Mei!
-Long time no see.

12:38.560 --> 12:40.650
-It's been a long time.
-You look pretty again.

12:40.650 --> 12:41.410
Thank you.

12:41.410 --> 12:42.740
You look beautiful too.

12:44.410 --> 12:45.940
-You scared me.
-Lu Xixiao!

12:46.010 --> 12:47.480
Did you two come together?

12:47.570 --> 12:48.430
Are you...

12:48.600 --> 12:49.530
-We didn't come together.
-Yeah.

12:49.530 --> 12:50.560
We came together.

12:50.560 --> 12:50.890
No.

12:50.890 --> 12:51.720
I came with Gu Meng.

12:51.720 --> 12:52.890
No, I brought her here.

12:52.890 --> 12:53.600
I even went to the movies

12:53.600 --> 12:54.720
with Gu Meng earlier.

12:54.720 --> 12:55.010
No.

12:54.940 --> 13:01.020
[The Kite Adventure Story]

12:55.010 --> 12:56.270
We just came together.

13:01.150 --> 13:01.720
Zhou Wan,

13:01.800 --> 13:03.130
I heard Jiang Yan is back.

13:03.130 --> 13:04.050
Wan,

13:04.680 --> 13:06.370
are you two really together now?

13:06.370 --> 13:07.980
Then what about Jiang Yan?

13:08.050 --> 13:08.870
You really know how to hit a nerve.

13:08.870 --> 13:09.960
Move aside.

13:09.980 --> 13:10.840
Get out of here.

13:18.280 --> 13:19.540
I... I'll go find Ping.

13:22.440 --> 13:23.220
Ping!

13:24.200 --> 13:25.010
Zhou Wan?

13:25.250 --> 13:26.250
Long time no see.

13:26.250 --> 13:27.130
Long time no see.

13:27.130 --> 13:27.860
Have a drink.

13:29.080 --> 13:30.880
You're the one who led me astray.

13:31.680 --> 13:32.840
You were going to drink
sooner or later anyway.

13:32.070 --> 13:37.580
[Age doesn't matter—happiness forever.
Happy Birthday!]

13:34.080 --> 13:35.940
How have you been all these years?

13:35.940 --> 13:37.170
Just living a normal life.

13:37.170 --> 13:37.680
And you?

13:38.770 --> 13:39.800
Same as always.

13:40.860 --> 13:42.790
Things haven't changed much here.

13:43.370 --> 13:44.050
Wan,

13:44.600 --> 13:45.660
there's something

13:45.960 --> 13:47.480
I've been wanting

13:47.480 --> 13:48.680
to tell you for years.

13:49.080 --> 13:50.130
I just never had the chance.

13:50.130 --> 13:51.930
Don't beat around the bush, Ping.

13:51.930 --> 13:53.230
Just say whatever you want to say.

13:53.230 --> 13:53.940
I'll do it.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.620
It's fine. I'll do it with you.

13:56.440 --> 13:57.640
Then I'll just say it.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.140
After you and Xixiao broke up,

14:01.840 --> 14:03.440
he fell seriously ill.

14:04.440 --> 14:05.650
He lost so much weight

14:05.930 --> 14:07.680
you could barely recognize him.

14:07.680 --> 14:09.070
When I went to see him,

14:09.170 --> 14:11.210
he had locked himself in his apartment.

14:11.210 --> 14:12.810
He was burning up with fever,

14:12.930 --> 14:14.420
talking nonsense,

14:15.170 --> 14:16.050
just lying there calling your name—

14:16.050 --> 14:17.800
"Zhou Wan… Zhou Wan…"

14:19.080 --> 14:20.880
I only heard it when I got closer.

14:21.010 --> 14:22.740
He just kept calling your name.

14:25.320 --> 14:27.520
I'd never seen Xixiao like that.

14:28.130 --> 14:30.960
He had changed so much
I could barely recognize him.

14:30.960 --> 14:32.820
Back then, I really resented you.

14:33.720 --> 14:34.680
I've always treated him

14:34.680 --> 14:36.280
like my own younger brother.

14:38.440 --> 14:39.640
Did you ever love him?

14:47.290 --> 14:48.950
It's not that I don't love him.

14:49.720 --> 14:50.840
I love him too much.

14:53.130 --> 14:54.020
Don't worry.

14:54.130 --> 14:54.770
I get it.

14:55.930 --> 14:56.800
I still keep

14:56.800 --> 14:58.050
my mouth shut like I did

14:58.050 --> 14:59.450
when we were young.

15:04.320 --> 15:04.930
For all these years,

15:04.930 --> 15:06.730
I've been having the same dream—

15:10.530 --> 15:13.190
he's lying there covered in blood
in front of me,

15:14.130 --> 15:16.390
no matter how I call him,
he won't wake up,

15:17.500 --> 15:18.430
he doesn't move.

15:22.290 --> 15:22.960
I just don't want

15:22.960 --> 15:24.580
that summer to happen again.

15:27.130 --> 15:28.290
I was too young then.

15:29.370 --> 15:31.170
I couldn't do anything about it.

15:34.410 --> 15:36.200
No matter how many regrets I had,

15:36.200 --> 15:38.060
I could only keep moving forward.

15:40.530 --> 15:41.770
Aren't you curious

15:41.930 --> 15:43.220
about how he lived

15:43.440 --> 15:44.700
after you two broke up?

15:46.890 --> 15:47.890
Tell me about it.

15:48.840 --> 15:49.530
He

15:49.650 --> 15:51.910
went through a period of total collapse,

15:52.290 --> 15:54.550
and then he started studying hard again.

15:54.800 --> 15:56.200
You know he is very smart.

15:56.650 --> 15:58.410
Anything he sets his mind to,

15:58.410 --> 15:59.480
he can get it done.

16:00.930 --> 16:02.010
Later, his grades

16:02.010 --> 16:03.010
became very good,

16:03.440 --> 16:05.680
and he got into a pretty good university.

16:05.680 --> 16:06.800
Not long after that, as you know,

16:06.800 --> 16:07.770
he went abroad.

16:08.930 --> 16:09.930
He got to where he is today step by step

16:09.930 --> 16:11.600
on his own.

16:12.290 --> 16:14.250
He never asked the Lu family
for a single cent,

16:14.250 --> 16:16.010
never owed anyone a favor.

16:16.840 --> 16:17.600
Back then,

16:17.600 --> 16:19.720
I was really worried he was
forcing himself too hard,

16:19.720 --> 16:20.650
but in the end,

16:20.840 --> 16:23.010
he really pulled himself up on his own.

16:25.650 --> 16:26.170
Wan,

16:26.930 --> 16:27.800
do you know

16:27.800 --> 16:29.400
why I'm telling you all this?

16:31.010 --> 16:32.550
Xixiao can be extreme

16:32.600 --> 16:34.000
in the way he does things,

16:34.410 --> 16:35.720
but he's not a bad person.

16:35.720 --> 16:37.650
He's never forgotten you.

16:37.770 --> 16:39.680
You've always been on his mind.

16:40.650 --> 16:42.170
He pushed himself so hard

16:42.680 --> 16:44.010
to grow up so fast.

16:45.600 --> 16:46.460
Why he did that—

16:46.530 --> 16:48.390
I believe you should understand.

16:49.840 --> 16:51.680
If you don't believe me,
compare him in that video

16:51.680 --> 16:53.320
with who he is now.

17:11.240 --> 17:12.770
♪ If you had ever seen the fireflies ♪

17:14.859 --> 17:16.230
♪ Inside my eyes ♪

17:19.130 --> 17:20.900
♪ I think you would understand ♪

17:22.440 --> 17:24.960
♪ Why I embrace the dark ♪

17:27.170 --> 17:28.900
♪ People always want to reach out ♪

17:30.400 --> 17:33.140
♪ But are afraid
to pull their hands back ♪

17:34.050 --> 17:36.800
♪ I choose to open my arms wide ♪

17:37.630 --> 17:39.480
♪ And enjoy the weightlessness ♪

17:43.080 --> 17:44.920
♪ If I could, I want to become ♪

17:46.490 --> 17:47.970
♪ An astronomer ♪

17:50.980 --> 17:53.110
♪ Lost in your night sky ♪

17:54.310 --> 17:57.320
♪ Then fall and fall and fall ♪

17:59.010 --> 18:01.270
♪ Maybe it's your gravity ♪

18:02.430 --> 18:04.990
♪ That held me back from losing control ♪

18:05.940 --> 18:08.670
♪ When you passed by me by accident ♪

18:09.950 --> 18:13.960
♪ I finally learned to fall ♪

18:16.850 --> 18:18.620
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

18:18.940 --> 18:20.750
♪ No time left, so I ♪

18:21.080 --> 18:23.420
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

18:25.140 --> 18:27.850
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

18:27.930 --> 18:31.430
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

18:33.330 --> 18:35.670
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

18:35.770 --> 18:39.490
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

18:41.330 --> 18:42.660
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

18:42.710 --> 18:45.570
♪ This mud all over me ♪

18:46.380 --> 18:49.100
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

19:05.290 --> 19:06.600
♪ Countless, unforgettable ♪

19:07.320 --> 19:08.750
♪ No time left, so I ♪

19:09.370 --> 19:11.270
♪ Can only fall toward you ♪

19:13.350 --> 19:15.870
♪ Too dazzling, too lonely, it's alright ♪

19:16.190 --> 19:19.520
♪ I believe in this encounter ♪

19:21.490 --> 19:24.120
♪ Landing in the ruins of the galaxy ♪

19:24.210 --> 19:27.640
♪ Exchanging our comets ♪

19:29.770 --> 19:30.940
♪ Suddenly I am certain ♪

19:30.970 --> 19:33.670
♪ This mud all over me ♪

19:34.570 --> 19:36.980
♪ Is the proof of love ♪

19:57.550 --> 19:59.010
♪ I can't remember and can't go back ♪

19:59.080 --> 20:01.090
♪ If you can't hold it tightly, let me ♪

20:01.230 --> 20:03.210
♪ Fly without hesitation ♪

20:05.230 --> 20:07.540
♪ Sorry, I'm too capricious and obsessed ♪

20:08.470 --> 20:11.450
♪ The Milky Way is drowning ♪

20:13.320 --> 20:15.520
♪ If one day you fall into ♪

20:15.810 --> 20:20.100
♪ The gap a light-year away ♪

20:23.140 --> 20:24.840
♪ You'll find ♪

20:24.850 --> 20:26.200
I'll make you some honey water.

20:25.050 --> 20:27.200
♪ The scattered ashes ♪

20:26.200 --> 20:27.420
Wait a minute.

20:28.390 --> 20:29.280
Lie down properly.

20:28.730 --> 20:33.650
♪ Burns my heart ♪

20:54.960 --> 20:55.560
We're here.

20:55.560 --> 20:56.540
Don't hold me.

20:56.850 --> 20:57.650
I'm not drunk.

20:59.090 --> 21:00.240
Okay, okay.

21:00.890 --> 21:02.680
If you're not drunk,
why are you walking like this?

21:02.680 --> 21:03.630
I'm speechless.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.870
It's all your fault!

21:10.520 --> 21:12.240
I said we should go
buy lightbulbs together—

21:12.240 --> 21:13.090
now look,

21:13.090 --> 21:14.220
all of them are dead!

21:19.280 --> 21:20.960
What are you doing instead of sleeping?

21:20.960 --> 21:22.220
To fix the light bulbs.

21:28.830 --> 21:30.240
My goodness, just come down.

21:30.240 --> 21:31.300
It's late at night,

21:31.310 --> 21:32.480
why are you even messing with this?

21:32.480 --> 21:34.140
I can't sleep if I don't fix it.

21:34.570 --> 21:36.040
You might fall.

21:40.720 --> 21:41.240
Come down.

21:41.240 --> 21:42.240
Let me do it, okay?

21:42.650 --> 21:43.640
Leave me alone!

21:47.720 --> 21:48.280
Hold this for me.

21:48.280 --> 21:49.540
Shine the light for me.

21:49.570 --> 21:50.590
I'll fix it.

21:50.810 --> 21:51.480
Here.

21:54.610 --> 21:55.930
Don't point it at me.

21:55.930 --> 21:56.860
Point it here.

21:59.930 --> 22:01.410
Can you even do this?

22:02.000 --> 22:03.650
Don't you know what I'm capable of?

22:03.650 --> 22:05.340
Don't rush me. I just started.

22:06.240 --> 22:07.570
I can't hold it anymore.

22:07.930 --> 22:10.260
-Don't shake it.
-Are you done, Jiang Fan?

22:10.330 --> 22:11.410
Hurry up.

22:16.410 --> 22:17.540
Are you okay, honey?

22:22.040 --> 22:23.770
Did you hit yourself anywhere?

22:33.200 --> 22:35.260
Now you can sleep peacefully, right?

22:47.410 --> 22:48.550
Why are you crying?

22:52.280 --> 22:54.280
Did you hurt yourself when you fell?

22:58.480 --> 23:01.610
If only it had been like this earlier…

23:13.900 --> 23:14.810
Jiang Fan,

23:18.720 --> 23:20.640
I also wanted to

23:21.170 --> 23:22.570
fix lightbulbs with you.

23:25.720 --> 23:27.670
I wanted to

23:28.330 --> 23:29.930
pick out furniture with you.

23:31.040 --> 23:33.130
I wanted to

23:34.890 --> 23:38.560
slowly fill this house with you.

23:41.200 --> 23:43.170
I wanted us

23:44.770 --> 23:47.260
to live our lives together

23:47.720 --> 23:49.320
like a couple of silly fools.

23:51.240 --> 23:53.440
But you were always away.

23:55.570 --> 23:57.980
You were always away.

23:58.000 --> 23:58.800
I'm sorry.

23:59.230 --> 24:00.050
Honey.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.150
I'm sorry.

24:34.280 --> 24:36.130
It's very comfortable here.

24:36.330 --> 24:36.930
Come here.

24:37.170 --> 24:38.000
Lean on me.

24:45.680 --> 24:46.570
Open your mouth.

24:46.570 --> 24:48.260
I don't want to take the medicine.

24:48.260 --> 24:49.460
This is not medicine.

24:49.570 --> 24:51.230
I don't want to take medicine.

24:53.710 --> 24:55.850
Why are you so unreasonable
when you're drunk?

24:55.850 --> 24:56.680
Be good. Come on.

24:56.680 --> 24:57.610
Open your mouth.

24:58.040 --> 24:59.350
Then feed me.

24:59.570 --> 25:01.030
I'm feeding you right now.

25:11.170 --> 25:13.950
Am I dreaming?

25:17.330 --> 25:18.890
Lu Xixiao.

25:20.570 --> 25:21.890
Xiaoliu.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.280
If you think it's a dream,

25:24.280 --> 25:25.540
then it must be a dream.

25:43.280 --> 25:46.170
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

25:47.340 --> 25:49.390
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

25:49.890 --> 25:52.630
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

25:54.010 --> 25:55.850
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

25:56.890 --> 26:00.480
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

26:01.390 --> 26:04.920
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

26:06.930 --> 26:08.270
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

26:08.300 --> 26:09.170
♪ That I can fly ♪

26:12.590 --> 26:14.800
♪ But I never seem to close ♪

26:14.840 --> 26:16.840
♪ The dormer lock ♪

26:19.130 --> 26:20.090
Does it hurt?

26:19.300 --> 26:20.760
♪ Tell you stars were ♪

26:20.790 --> 26:21.920
♪ Above the floor ♪

26:22.630 --> 26:24.560
It stopped hurting a long time ago.

26:26.570 --> 26:27.760
I mean back then.

26:32.650 --> 26:34.380
I can't even remember anymore.

26:37.650 --> 26:38.960
Why did you

26:38.960 --> 26:40.330
take that stab for me back then?

26:40.330 --> 26:41.410
Because I love you.

26:52.760 --> 26:54.240
But you had other choices

26:54.240 --> 26:56.170
to avoid getting so badly injured.

27:00.200 --> 27:02.600
Do you know that
if it were any more serious,

27:03.280 --> 27:04.810
you wouldn't have woken up?

27:08.040 --> 27:09.090
Do you know?

27:23.280 --> 27:23.950
Enough.

27:42.200 --> 27:43.000
Zhou Wan,

27:47.380 --> 27:49.110
Actually, I have thought about

27:50.520 --> 27:51.410
why I took that stab for you

27:51.410 --> 27:52.200
back then.

27:56.410 --> 27:57.410
Perhaps,

28:01.330 --> 28:03.260
I just hoped you wouldn't get hurt.

28:09.650 --> 28:11.780
I couldn't think about anything else.

28:14.760 --> 28:16.220
I wanted you to care for me.

28:17.760 --> 28:19.290
I wanted you to stay with me.

28:22.680 --> 28:23.940
I wanted you to love me.

28:31.090 --> 28:33.040
But you just wouldn't believe me.

28:36.920 --> 28:37.610
When you were in the hospital

28:37.610 --> 28:39.740
keeping me company while I recovered,

28:40.410 --> 28:41.330
you were thinking every day

28:41.330 --> 28:42.930
about how to break up with me.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.570
I already made it

28:50.570 --> 28:52.140
very clear to you back then.

28:54.370 --> 28:56.970
I told you, all you had to do
was say you loved me,

29:00.170 --> 29:02.300
and I would have forgiven everything.

29:06.930 --> 29:08.480
But you wouldn't even say

29:10.520 --> 29:11.810
those three words.

29:24.970 --> 29:26.260
It's not like that.

29:28.570 --> 29:29.960
I thought that

29:31.930 --> 29:33.410
if I lied

29:35.280 --> 29:37.410
and told you I didn't love you anymore,

29:40.280 --> 29:41.440
you'd give up.

29:45.850 --> 29:47.040
I was wrong.

29:59.760 --> 30:00.950
Over the years,

30:06.410 --> 30:08.380
I've forced myself

30:10.000 --> 30:11.200
to stay away from you.

30:14.040 --> 30:16.130
But not for a single moment

30:17.480 --> 30:19.330
have I ever stopped loving you.

30:37.430 --> 30:40.060
♪ The first night, my sunset ♪

30:40.170 --> 30:43.650
♪ The whole world, the two of us♪

30:43.800 --> 30:47.060
♪ The city doesn't sleep, ups and downs ♪

30:47.200 --> 30:50.760
♪ Breathing at midnight ♪

30:51.900 --> 30:54.470
♪ Someone lights the fire ♪

30:52.410 --> 30:53.200
Zhou Wan.

30:54.670 --> 30:58.360
♪ The love burns each other ♪

30:56.890 --> 30:58.350
Aren't you going to sleep?

30:58.570 --> 31:01.380
♪ My organs ♪

31:01.560 --> 31:05.070
♪ Every midnight ♪

31:05.310 --> 31:08.050
♪ I'll play the instrument for you ♪

31:33.130 --> 31:35.530
I'm completely stuck with you
in this life.

31:49.370 --> 31:50.240
You're awake?

32:02.810 --> 32:03.480
I'm okay.

32:15.760 --> 32:17.170
I surrender, Zhou Wan.

32:20.130 --> 32:21.480
Give me another chance.

32:23.280 --> 32:25.280
Let me court you properly this time,

32:25.930 --> 32:26.650
okay?

33:36.810 --> 33:37.930
Need a hand?

33:41.370 --> 33:43.240
Didn't you say you'd let me woo you?

33:43.240 --> 33:44.600
Give me a chance.

33:48.410 --> 33:49.620
That smells amazing.

33:51.240 --> 33:53.300
Did you make all of these by yourself?

33:54.170 --> 33:55.100
That's amazing.

33:56.610 --> 33:57.370
Have a taste.

34:02.000 --> 34:02.680
It's so pretty.

34:02.680 --> 34:04.180
I can't bear to eat it.

34:12.370 --> 34:13.429
What are you doing?

34:15.730 --> 34:17.730
I'm replying to some work messages.

34:29.639 --> 34:30.440
What's wrong?

34:31.600 --> 34:32.639
I've got two

34:32.639 --> 34:34.949
important presentations today.

34:35.889 --> 34:38.820
They started messaging me
first thing this morning.

34:42.080 --> 34:43.159
Who do you

34:43.929 --> 34:45.120
report to?

34:47.120 --> 34:48.020
To you.

34:53.870 --> 34:56.760
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

34:57.930 --> 34:59.980
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

35:00.490 --> 35:03.100
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

35:04.600 --> 35:06.440
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

35:05.070 --> 35:06.600
I've approved your report.

35:07.480 --> 35:11.070
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

35:09.760 --> 35:10.670
Let's eat.

35:11.970 --> 35:15.510
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

35:17.520 --> 35:18.860
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

35:18.730 --> 35:19.410
Try it.

35:18.880 --> 35:20.400
♪ That I can fly ♪

35:20.770 --> 35:22.030
Why aren't you eating?

35:22.810 --> 35:23.730
I'll watch you eat.

35:22.850 --> 35:23.690
♪ Long time no see ♪

35:23.770 --> 35:25.110
♪ You haven't been here ♪

35:26.090 --> 35:28.520
♪ Stop watch has seen the changes ♪

35:29.270 --> 35:31.210
♪ I'm sure you won't forget ♪

35:30.300 --> 35:31.050
Is it good?

35:31.240 --> 35:33.200
♪ The door you ever knocked ♪

35:34.760 --> 35:36.880
♪ So I sent you a clock ♪

35:36.900 --> 35:38.800
♪ To recover the deadlock ♪

35:39.930 --> 35:42.140
♪ It's like I'm losing my sword ♪

35:40.400 --> 35:41.290
Sit down.

35:43.490 --> 35:46.170
♪ Chop off the line
between the loving core ♪

35:48.550 --> 35:50.000
If you like it,

35:48.720 --> 35:51.270
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

35:50.680 --> 35:52.340
I'll make it for you every day.

35:52.800 --> 35:54.380
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

35:55.550 --> 35:58.050
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

35:59.690 --> 36:01.320
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

36:02.440 --> 36:05.690
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

36:06.980 --> 36:10.070
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

36:12.490 --> 36:14.410
♪ Nescience doesn't mean that I can fly ♪

36:32.480 --> 36:33.290
Jiang Fan!

36:34.080 --> 36:35.120
You actually took advantage of me

36:35.120 --> 36:36.120
while I was drunk!

36:36.330 --> 36:37.600
Do you realize that even
between husband and wife,

36:37.600 --> 36:38.580
that's illegal?

36:38.850 --> 36:41.180
Let alone now that we're going to divorce.

36:45.040 --> 36:45.730
Come on,

36:46.120 --> 36:47.760
be reasonable, would you?

36:48.040 --> 36:48.960
Last night,

36:49.730 --> 36:51.410
you were the one clinging to me

36:51.410 --> 36:53.070
and falling asleep in my arms.

36:53.370 --> 36:54.520
Did I break the law?

36:56.520 --> 36:57.330
Then let's just pretend none of it

36:57.330 --> 36:58.290
ever happened.

36:58.770 --> 37:00.440
We're already divorced anyway.

37:00.440 --> 37:01.040
Neither of us

37:01.040 --> 37:02.440
owes the other anything.

37:07.640 --> 37:08.330
Gu Meng,

37:09.600 --> 37:10.410
how long are you going to

37:10.410 --> 37:11.330
keep this up?

37:11.960 --> 37:13.690
Can't we just sit down and talk?

37:15.640 --> 37:16.290
Jiang Fan,

37:17.520 --> 37:18.560
do you still think

37:18.560 --> 37:20.160
I'm just throwing a tantrum?

37:26.210 --> 37:27.540
That's not what I meant.

37:28.250 --> 37:29.530
I just mean...

37:29.960 --> 37:31.120
Whatever the problem is,

37:31.120 --> 37:32.440
just tell me.

37:32.960 --> 37:33.600
Otherwise, I don't even know

37:33.600 --> 37:34.960
why you want a divorce.

37:35.850 --> 37:37.980
That's exactly your biggest problem!

37:38.890 --> 37:39.560
Jiang Fan,

37:40.440 --> 37:42.300
we've been together for 10 years.

37:42.810 --> 37:44.210
We've been married for 3.

37:44.250 --> 37:45.290
And you still don't know

37:45.290 --> 37:46.290
what I want.

37:47.330 --> 37:49.530
You don't even know why I want a divorce.

37:51.520 --> 37:52.290
Forget it.

37:54.320 --> 37:55.040
Forget it?

37:55.040 --> 37:55.560
There you go again.

37:55.560 --> 37:56.770
You stop halfway and
never finish what you're trying to say.

37:56.770 --> 37:58.850
If I don't know, then tell me!

37:59.210 --> 37:59.730
Hey!

37:59.730 --> 38:00.440
Why do we always

38:00.440 --> 38:01.290
have to play guessing games?

38:01.290 --> 38:02.790
We are all adults.

38:03.000 --> 38:04.440
We work hard all day.

38:05.080 --> 38:06.210
If there's something you want,

38:06.210 --> 38:07.080
just tell me directly.

38:07.080 --> 38:07.690
I'll do it.

38:07.690 --> 38:08.890
Isn't that good?

38:14.040 --> 38:15.290
If I have to

38:15.870 --> 38:17.870
ask for everything I need in my life,

38:20.520 --> 38:23.050
then I'd rather not
have that marriage at all.

38:29.120 --> 38:35.330
[Key Milestone Control]

38:39.330 --> 38:39.850
Hello?

38:42.040 --> 38:43.850
Why did it take you so long to answer?

38:43.850 --> 38:44.910
What are you doing?

38:46.040 --> 38:47.100
Eating,

38:48.890 --> 38:49.970
obviously.

38:51.410 --> 38:52.540
What are you having?

38:52.810 --> 38:55.160
Spicy chicken, stir-fried pork,

38:56.370 --> 38:57.370
and braised ribs.

39:00.690 --> 39:01.660
That's okay.

39:01.740 --> 39:05.340
[Construction Phase]

39:02.290 --> 39:03.150
What about you?

39:03.190 --> 39:04.270
You skipped work.

39:04.290 --> 39:05.820
How is your painting going?

39:08.160 --> 39:09.040
Let me correct you.

39:09.040 --> 39:10.390
I didn't skip work.

39:10.690 --> 39:12.080
I cleared it with my aunt.

39:12.080 --> 39:13.490
This is approved leave.

39:15.290 --> 39:16.120
Back in school, you were the one

39:16.120 --> 39:17.440
who skipped class the most.

39:17.440 --> 39:19.440
Now you're acting all respectable?

39:20.890 --> 39:22.160
Have you eaten?

39:24.330 --> 39:26.040
I'm at a restaurant right now.

39:27.850 --> 39:28.650
A restaurant?

39:28.850 --> 39:30.090
Why is it so quiet?

39:32.380 --> 39:33.580
I'm in a private room.

39:34.520 --> 39:36.520
You really think I can't tell

39:36.520 --> 39:38.420
the difference between a private room
and the echo in your studio?

39:38.420 --> 39:42.090
[Key Milestone Control]

39:38.890 --> 39:39.760
Ms. Wan!

39:40.890 --> 39:42.210
I brought you some fried rice.

39:42.210 --> 39:43.210
You looked busy earlier,

39:43.210 --> 39:44.440
so I didn't want to interrupt you.

39:44.440 --> 39:45.250
Remember to eat.

39:45.250 --> 39:46.520
I'm leaving. Remember to eat.

39:46.520 --> 39:47.840
Thank you. Thank you, Xin.

39:47.840 --> 39:50.580
So you had spicy chicken,

39:50.820 --> 39:53.260
stir-fried pork, and braised ribs

39:53.890 --> 39:54.520
and now your coworker

39:54.520 --> 39:55.850
brought you fried rice.

39:56.040 --> 39:56.690
Right?

40:00.080 --> 40:01.120
Alright, alright.

40:01.120 --> 40:02.040
You should go find yourself somewhere

40:02.040 --> 40:02.930
and eat properly.

40:02.930 --> 40:04.260
Stop worrying about me.

40:04.850 --> 40:05.560
Zhou Wan,

40:05.960 --> 40:06.890
put down

40:06.890 --> 40:07.600
whatever you're working on

40:07.600 --> 40:08.440
and go eat.

40:08.440 --> 40:09.250
Xiaoliu!

40:09.640 --> 40:11.210
Okay, okay.

40:11.890 --> 40:13.560
Then you should also find a restaurant

40:13.560 --> 40:14.770
and eat properly.

40:15.640 --> 40:16.440
Okay?

40:19.440 --> 40:21.080
Okay, I'll listen to you.

40:24.290 --> 40:25.290
I'll hang up then.

40:26.770 --> 40:27.370
Bye-bye.

40:37.640 --> 40:39.370
Xiaoliu, come here. Come here.

40:39.600 --> 40:40.250
Xiaoliu!

40:40.600 --> 40:41.210
Come here.

40:42.250 --> 40:43.980
Who told you to eat my sandwich?

40:48.710 --> 40:51.000
Back then the project wasn't standardized,

40:51.000 --> 40:52.440
and there were no digital records.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.700
It wasn't easy to find.

40:55.250 --> 40:56.930
It's fine. I'll just take a quick look

40:56.930 --> 40:58.040
to see if there's anything in Phase II

40:58.040 --> 40:59.080
we can learn from.

41:00.000 --> 41:00.690
I found it.

41:07.410 --> 41:08.120
Don't worry.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.730
I've already spoken to Mr. Lu.

41:09.730 --> 41:10.560
If there are any issues,

41:10.560 --> 41:11.760
tell him to come to me.

41:12.000 --> 41:12.480
Okay.

41:12.480 --> 41:14.120
Please sign here.

41:14.600 --> 41:15.120
Okay.

41:20.250 --> 41:20.730
Okay.

41:21.480 --> 41:23.120
How about I bring it to your office?

41:23.120 --> 41:23.600
No need.

41:23.600 --> 41:24.640
I can do it myself.

41:24.890 --> 41:26.690
It's time for you to get off work.

41:26.730 --> 41:28.190
Okay, I'll get going then.

42:04.130 --> 42:05.850
[Land Acquisition Agreement Between Lan Yue Group
and Jun'an Building Materials Factory]

42:05.870 --> 42:07.470
[Agreement on the RMB 350,000 Purchase Price
for Jun'an Building Materials Factory]

42:08.850 --> 42:10.560
The acquisition price
of Jun'an Building Materials Factory

42:10.560 --> 42:11.760
is surprisingly low.

42:23.360 --> 42:26.440
[Supplementary Explanation of the Reason
for the Low Purchase Price]

42:25.250 --> 42:27.410
The soil contamination on the site

42:26.470 --> 42:30.490
[Estimated Value: RMB 1.2 Million
(Previously Appraised at RMB 800,000)]

42:27.410 --> 42:29.270
exceeds the initial assessment.

42:38.370 --> 42:39.080
Zhou Wan,

42:39.850 --> 42:41.160
so the one you want to deal with is

42:41.160 --> 42:42.080
Lu Zhongyue.

42:43.290 --> 42:44.560
Is that why you said

42:45.000 --> 42:46.250
neither Lu Xixiao nor I

42:46.250 --> 42:47.890
were up to the task?
